<decision #migrate-cell-data-graph-foundations.consumer-read apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73C>
  How should stage consumers read declared dependencies under 1.0.1?
  </?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73C>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73D>
    Through the owning DataGraph.
    </?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73D>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73E>
    Replace callback ctx.get(ref) reads with supported graph reads over the same module refs.
    </?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73E>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73F>
    The target consumer callback is an effect trigger, not an ambient graph reader.
    </?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73F>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73G>
    G5 verification and upstream unified graph tests.
    </?01M05F1PMSWCQ90PAHDQ5YF73G>
  )>
)>
